id: pm-gh1364
title: "GH-1364: preserve tracker scope and valid projection in recovery"
description: "Implement existing GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1364. Retain original invocation scope, renderer and unrelated valid controls when repairing field projection or full/intent conflicts."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-01T09:24:18.862Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-02T00:55:50.284Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-02T00:41:51.352Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-02T00:41:51.352Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Exact retry reads the explicitly selected colliding tracker;JSON and all valid selectors survive correction;Aliases and attached flags retain unrelated options;Unsafe ambiguous retry is omitted and mutation recovery safety remains intact
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Recovery minimally repairs the original invocation while preserving environment-default or explicit tracker selection, JSON, valid selectors, mode and unrelated controls; ambiguous unsafe retries are withheld."
expected_result: "Exact emitted retries preserve environment-default or explicit selected tracker, JSON and unrelated controls; final source verification is recorded before closure"
actual_result: "Canonical recovery receipt test-local-muq2xjyr-0neonz passes 28 cases, including colliding trackers, environment defaults, legacy/attached flags, flag-looking values, projection modes, explain and both token_budget spellings. Exact producing coverage is lines 63216/63216, statements 66255/66255, functions 13712/13712, branches 50731/50731; all files have zero deficits. Final source 92cff9ef184f8b6e932afccc999b24c86f070c30: full-source producing receipt test-local-muq885vf-vje4y3 on canonical owner pm-gh1364 passes 9501 tests with zero failures and 2 Windows-only skips. Its fifteen observed metrics record all four exact 100-percent coverage gates and integer totals; summary SHA256 70cc18dc59614d3a42993046ce1f454131daa8f92f4133fb363abad0132167f0. Complete pnpm quality:static passes test-local-muq8lpre-ketrg6 on supported Node 22.21.1 with unchanged ceilings. Focused lint, four type configurations and SDK import-boundary checks pass test-local-muq6r2d8-g2xkay. Earlier failed runs remain failed without measurements. Final hosted/provider review and independent merge clearance remain pending; live telemetry and opt-in semantic dogfood are unrun."
