    text: Hosted Windows regression exposed a POSIX path literal in the new refusal fixture. Expected scope now uses platform path.join; exact argv and unsafe-scope negative control are unchanged. Added structured gate evidence required by the post-close defect gate. Prior static success preceded closure and did not validate this terminal-only requirement; final checks are rerunning.
