    text: "Recovery review corrections pass focused CLI/SDK replay tests, lint and all four type checks: legacy/canonical tracker flags consume flag-looking values including literal --, selected full/brief/compact survives generic suggestions, and supported root --explain remains intact before/after the command. Actual CLI already normalizes both token_budget forms before recovery; scanner now also canonicalizes declared aliases defensively. No merge or live telemetry transmission performed."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:31:00.168Z"
