    text: "Full-source linked run on dd42b1f3c recorded a failed receipt: 9472 passed, 12 failed, two skipped. One failure was the introduced 121-file SDK test directory; eleven were fixture behavior changed by inherited global telemetry opt-outs. No live telemetry was sent. Corrected directory grouping plus a process-only network namespace (loopback available, no external route; original host settings and queues untouched) now pass all 138 affected tests without weakening assertions. Full coverage will rerun under this containment; previous failed metrics are not passing evidence."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:55:48.713Z"
