    text: "Review correction: failed run test-local-mupv1k68-926ate now carries no measurements. Its four provisional 100-percent values were invalid because the coverage gate failed; the original failed receipt and immutable history remain intact. The CLI exposes no prior-receipt measurement edit, so this exact-row correction used the checked-out PM mutateItem test_run_track operation with automatic author, item locking, no force, and immutable history. Future measurements will be recorded only from an actually passing producing gate."
