    text: "Final-source full coverage producing receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e (pm-gh1364) passed on 09ba3c30ec10e637f111b477a46e252b4558d241: 9494 test cases passed, zero failed, two Windows-only skips; exact integer gate passed for lines 63200/63200, statements 66237/66237, functions 13710/13710 and branches 50719/50719. Its canonical passing test_runs row now carries four observed percent gates plus all covered/total dimensions and test-case counts; linked-command passed=1 remains the runner's command count. coverage-summary SHA256=40c980160ae95b9591e5cbb4ac483ee7ca5d42ee7140beb205e2c1e9f38650c6. Measurements were attached only after the actual gate passed using PM's locked test_run_track operation, automatic author and immutable history. Earlier failed receipts remain failed without measurements. This is one shared full-corpus producing receipt, referenced through real related edges by pm-gh1370 and pm-gh1371, not three separate executions. Local static/context/package aggregates and final exact-head hosted/reviewer checks remain pending. No live telemetry delivery or merge performed."
