    text: "Controlled original-checkout comparison preserved the branch and local main: PR base 89b4aa8bb and checkpoint 2916c6e2f both passed unchanged SDK import ceilings with 15 measured samples. The same ten-sample CLI transport gate failed on both: base get365>362ms, next461>440ms, create419>398ms; head get366>362ms, next451>440ms, create426>398ms. Mixed small changes do not establish a patch-specific regression; the existing local transport admission failure remains a blocker and no budget was weakened. Canonical test-local-muq0nuea-dqzwjn passes graph/record integrity plus bounded mutation (329/336 killed, seven existing equivalents); test-local-muq0up1n-tew4bo passes context relevance, unchanged artifact budget, 89 package-first commands and nine-package npx/Bunx packed smoke. Opt-in semantic dogfood and live external telemetry were unrun. The full static receipt remains failed; no all-static-passed claim is made. Current coverage/focused/type receipts remain valid for unchanged implementation source. Merge awaits final hosted/provider review, resolution of the local timing blocker and independent final-head clearance."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T21:45:09.899Z"
