    text: "Final-source static attempt test-local-muq3ukgy-ylz7yg failed at tracker-context validation: canonical reopen had cleared expected_result on two active items. Both expectations are restored through PM; gates and thresholds unchanged. Prior source stages (docstrings, exports, whole ESLint, duplicate scans, contracts, package boundaries, recovery/token gates) completed; subsequent import/transport/graph/record/mutation stages were unrun. This failed receipt carries no measurements. The recovery record is now reopened/claimed with terminal fields cleared for the post-close replay addition, so current metadata makes no final-head full-corpus or all-static passing claim. Historical producing receipts and closure events remain intact."
