    text: "Fresh full static receipt test-local-muq4ypom-186wlk failed at the CLI transport floor: create best 564ms exceeded 398ms and claim best 596ms exceeded 415ms. Earlier static stages, tracker-context quality and SDK imports passed; later graph, record-integrity and mutation stages did not run. The failed receipt carries no measurements. Separate isolated profiling on the same source found 35-46ms mutation handlers and 327-392ms end-to-end create/claim runs, with and without linked-test source coordinates; this is diagnostic evidence, not a passing aggregate gate. Thresholds remain unchanged. Fresh full-source coverage has not yet run on the filesystem repair."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T23:49:33.034Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Fresh contained full-source receipt test-local-muq6db5k-wge0th failed with 9495 passed, 3 failed and 5 skipped. Two tests received Node 24.12 experimental SQLite warnings on stderr; the packed install fixture hit mise reshim writing to the read-only home mount. The coverage summary was not emitted and no measurements were recorded. Under installed Node 26.9 (within the declared >=22.18.0 range), with only process-scoped MISE_SKIP_RESHIM=1 and the same loopback-only/read-only-home containment, canonical test-local-muq6hxze-j7z27d passes all 14 tests in the three failing owners. This prevents host shim changes without suppressing runtime warnings or changing assertions. Complete static passed on d57ac9146 in test-local-muq5w3jj-ktjlak; a final-source aggregate refresh follows the fixture correction."
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T00:18:24.807Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final-source coverage receipt test-local-muq7lhr0-obab3u has 9498 passing cases, zero test failures and five skips, but fails the exact coverage gate: one extension cleanup branch and one unreadable merge-receipt statement/line were omitted by permission tests skipped under namespace uid 0. No measurements are attached to this failed receipt. A non-root uid 1000 namespace with zero capabilities and only loopback was verified to return EACCES for a denied file and accept local sockets; the same unchanged corpus and gates will be rerun there. Final-source static receipt test-local-muq74qi4-km3b0s remains failed at SDK median 634ms versus 500ms. On installed supported Node 22.21.1, canonical tail receipt test-local-muq7qbfs-cnws8d passes the larger 15-sample import gate, default 10-sample transport gate, graph composition, record integrity and bounded mutation (329/336 killed; seven reviewed equivalents). This tail receipt does not rewrite the failed complete static attempt. All 35 inline threads are now resolved after exact-head evidence checks; the updated CodSpeed advisory is decoder -1.4% with no runtime warning, whose cause remains unproven. Final-source configured reviews and live telemetry approval remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T00:31:54.239Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final source 92cff9ef184f8b6e932afccc999b24c86f070c30 now has passing full-source producing receipt test-local-muq885vf-vje4y3: 9501 tests passed, zero failed, two Windows-only skips. Exact integer coverage is lines 63216/63216, statements 66255/66255, functions 13712/13712 and branches 50731/50731; all four quantitative gates are 100 percent, and each file has zero deficits. Fifteen observed coverage and case-count measurements are attached to that actual passing receipt through the locked PM test_run_track operation. Summary SHA256 is 70cc18dc59614d3a42993046ce1f454131daa8f92f4133fb363abad0132167f0. The corpus ran under supported Node 26.9 with namespace uid 1000, zero capabilities and loopback only; denied-file tests retained EACCES semantics. Failed root and runtime attempts remain failed with no measurements. Complete final-source static is now running on installed supported Node 22.21.1 without concurrent coverage load; its earlier passing tail is not a substitute for aggregate success. Review and live telemetry decisions remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T00:52:28.038Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Post-closure receipts test-local-muq8rzg8-xr7qul and test-local-muq8xgty-9z57es remain failed with no measurements. Both pass terminal defect evidence, validator ok:true (existing historical warnings), all 47 tracker-context assertions and record integrity, then fail only the changelog check against the tracker-only sandbox. The generator derives tagged release membership from ctx.pm_root; the copied tracker lacks the original Git membership. The identical read-only check against the actual checkout passes with action:unchanged and 464685 bytes. The linked command is corrected to keep defect/history checks sandboxed; changelog generation and verification are separate repository operations using the installed latest package and refreshed tags. No implementation source or gate threshold changes."
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T00:54:32.082Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Reviewed closeout checks now pass canonical receipt test-local-muq92u8a-hr6iiu: terminal-only defect evidence, validator ok:true with pre-existing historical warnings, all 47 tracker-context assertions and record integrity. The actual repository changelog check independently returns action:unchanged after package generation from refreshed tag windows. This is a repository operation, because a tracker-only copy cannot supply original Git release membership; the two failed setup receipts are preserved with no measurements. The final evidence commit includes closed/released records and generated changelog, with unchanged implementation source. Actual manual CodeRabbit and Sourcery reviews will be requested on the published head; merge remains held pending those outcomes, independent clearance and outstanding user decisions."
